-white/[0.025] px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-400 sm:w-auto sm:border-transparent sm:bg-transparent sm:px-0 sm:py-0 w-full sm:w-auto\" title=\"Page views hari ini\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"shrink-0 text-base leading-none\">👁</span><span class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">Pengunjung Hari Ini</span><strong class=\"min-w-[1.5rem] text-right text-sm font-black text-zinc-100\">…</strong></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-200 shadow-lg shadow-black/10 backdrop-blur-xl transition hover:border-cyan-400/35 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.05] hover:text-white active:scale-[0.98] sm:min-h-11 sm:rounded-2xl sm:px-4 sm:py-3 sm:text-sm\" aria-label=\"Kembali ke Dashboard\"><span class=\"text-base leading-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">←</span><span>Kembali</span></button><label class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#090e16]/95 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-300 backdrop-blur-xl \"><span>🌐</span><span class=\"hidden md:inline\">Pilih Bahasa</span><select class=\"cursor-pointer bg-transparent text-xs font-black text-white outline-none\" aria-label=\"Pilih bahasa\"><option value=\"id\" class=\"bg-[#090e16]\" selected=\"\">🇮🇩 Indonesia</option><option value=\"en\" class=\"bg-[#090e16]\">🇬🇧 English</option></select></label></div></div></header><div class=\"workspace-two-col grid gap-7 xl:gap-8\"><section class=\"workspace-form h-fit rounded-[28px] border border-white/[0.09] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0b1019] to-[#080c14] p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] sm:p-6\"><div class=\"mb-7\"><h2 class=\"mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-white\">Buat Animasi</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[16px] leading-7 text-zinc-300\">Kamu cukup menentukan arah cerita. Detail produksi dikerjakan otomatis oleh Driacom.</p></div><fieldset aria-busy=\"false\" class=\"space-y-7 disabled:opacity-90\"><div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[22px]\">Jenis Konten Animasi</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400\">Satu engine untuk berbagai format. Driacom menyesuaikan cara membuat prompt berdasarkan pilihan ini.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Jenis Konten Animasi</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#12151c] px-5 py-4 text-left text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition hover:border-cyan-400/45\"><span>Petualangan</span><span class=\"text-cyan-300 transition \">⌄</span></button></div></div><div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[22px]\">Ide / Topik</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400\">Jenis konten: Petualangan. Tulis ide singkat atau minta Driacom mencarikannya.</p></div><textarea id=\"idea-input\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Seorang anak menemukan pintu rahasia di tengah hutan dan memutuskan untuk membukanya...\" class=\"w-full resize-none rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#12151c] px-5 py-4 text-[16px] leading-7 font-medium text-white outline-none transition placeholder:text-zinc-400 focus:border-cyan-400/70 focus:bg-[#151922]\"></textarea><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-3 w-full rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/25 bg-cyan-400/[0.08] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-cyan-200 transition hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.15] disabled:opacity-50\">✦ AI Driacom — Bantu Buat Ide</button></div><div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[22px]\">Gaya Visual</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400\">Driacom menyesuaikan seluruh desain visual.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Gaya Visual</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#12151c] px-5 py-4 text-left text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition hover:border-cyan-400/45\"><span>Pixar Inspired 3D</span><span class=\"text-cyan-300 transition \">⌄</span></button></div></div><div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[22px]\">Jumlah Karakter</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400\">Driacom membuat identitas karakter otomatis.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-5 gap-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/70 bg-cyan-400/15 px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-cyan-100 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.08)]\">1</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">2</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">3</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">4</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">5</button></div><div class=\"mt-3 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/15 bg-cyan-400/[0.05] p-4\"><p class=\"text-[15px] font-bold leading-6 text-cyan-100\">✓ Driacom membuat nama, wajah, pakaian, kepribadian, proporsi, aksesori, dan identitas visual karakter.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[22px]\">Struktur Video</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400\">Atur scene, durasi, ratio, dan bahasa.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-[#11141a] p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div><p class=\"text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-100\">Jumlah Scene</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-zinc-400\">1 sampai 10 scene</p></div><div class=\"flex h-12 min-w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-cyan-400/30 bg-cyan-400/10 px-3 text-xl font-bold text-cyan-200\">4</div></div><input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" class=\"mt-5 w-full accent-cyan-400\" value=\"4\"/><div class=\"mt-2 flex justify-between text-[13px] font-bold text-zinc-500\"><span>1</span><span>5</span><span>10</span></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\"><label class=\"mb-2.5 block text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-100\">Durasi per Scene</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">4s</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">6s</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/70 bg-cyan-400/15 px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-cyan-100 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.08)]\">8s</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">10s</button></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\"><label class=\"mb-2.5 block text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-100\">Ratio Video</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/70 bg-cyan-400/15 px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-cyan-100 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.08)]\">9:16</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">16:9</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">1:1</button></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\"><label class=\"mb-2.5 block text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-100\">Bahasa</label><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Bahasa</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#12151c] px-5 py-4 text-left text-[16px] font-bold text-white transition hover:border-cyan-400/45\"><span>Bahasa Indonesia</span><span class=\"text-cyan-300 transition \">⌄</span></button></div></div></div><div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[22px]\">Audio</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400\">Pilih elemen suara yang digunakan.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/70 bg-cyan-400/15 px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-cyan-100 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.08)]\">Narasi + BGM + SFX</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">Narasi + BGM</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">Narasi + SFX</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">BGM + SFX</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">Hanya Narasi</button></div></div><div><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[22px]\">Siapa yang Berbicara?</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-zinc-400\">Tentukan sumber suara cerita.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/70 bg-cyan-400/15 px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-cyan-100 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.08)]\">Ada karakter yang bicara</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">Ada narator saja</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full text-left rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#11141a] px-4 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.06] hover:text-white\">Ada karakter + narator</button></div><div class=\"mt-3 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/15 bg-cyan-400/[0.04] p-4\"><p class=\"text-[14px] font-bold leading-6 text-cyan-100\">✓ Setiap scene akan memiliki naskah dialog karakter sesuai perkembangan cerita.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-6\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-center text-xs text-zinc-500\">Mengecek kuota...</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400 px-5 py-5 text-[17px] font-bold text-black shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(34,211,238,0.15)] transition hover:bg-cyan-300 active:scale-[0.99] disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-60\">✦ Racik Prompt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-3 w-full rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-white/[0.04] px-5 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-zinc-300 transition hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:text-white\">Reset</button></div></fieldset></section><div class=\"workspace-mid-ad\"></div><section id=\"hasil-output\" class=\"workspace-output min-w-0 rounded-[28px] border border-white/[0.09] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0b1019] to-[#080c14] p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] sm:p-6\"><div class=\"flex min-h-[700px] items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border border-dashed border-white/12 bg-[#0a0d12] p-8 text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-lg\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-6 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/10 text-3xl text-cyan-300\">✦</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">Animation Workspace</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[16px] leading-7 text-zinc-300\">Isi ide cerita dan beberapa pilihan dasar. Driacom akan membuat karakter, dunia, scene, naskah dialog, image prompt, video prompt, dan audio direction.</p><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-4\"><p class=\"text-xl\">👤</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-bold text-white\">Karakter</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-zinc-400\">Identity Lock</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-4\"><p class=\"text-xl\">💬</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-bold text-white\">Dialog</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-zinc-400\">Scene Script</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-4\"><p class=\"text-xl\">🖼️</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-bold text-white\">Image</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-zinc-400\">Start Frame</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-4\"><p class=\"text-xl\">🎥</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] font-bold text-white\">Video</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-zinc-400\">Motion Prompt</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><footer class=\"mt-10 border-t b